<title>LEBANON: Lebanon trade deficit widens to $599 mln in Oct.</title>
<headline>Lebanon trade deficit widens to $599 mln in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon's trade deficit was $599 million in October compared with $525 million in September and $584 million in October 1995, customs figures showed.</p>
<p>    MERCHANDISE TRADE	Oct  96     Sept 96     Oct  95</p>
<p>Monthly</p>
<p>    Exports		     91.0	  99.0	  84.0</p>
<p>    Imports		    690.0	 624.0	 668.0</p>
<p>    Trade balance	   -599.0	-525.0	-584.0</p>
<p>Year-to-date</p>
<p>    Exports		    833.0	 742.0	 664.0</p>
<p>    Imports		  6,148.0     5,458.0     6,101.0</p>
<p>    Trade balance	 -5,315.0    -4,716.0    -5,437.0</p>
<p>Note - Figures in millions of U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (961 1) 864148 602057 353078 645456</p>
</text>
